<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 5: </span>The evaluation model prompt and few-shot examples used to compute the <span id="LST5.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">detection</span> scores of natural language feature descriptions. <span id="LST5.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;system&gt;&lt;/system&gt;</span>, <span id="LST5.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;user&gt;&lt;/user&gt;</span>, and <span id="LST5.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;assistant&gt;&lt;/assistant&gt;</span> delineate the message roles passed to the evaluation model.</figcaption>
</figure>
