<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 6: </span>The evaluation model prompt and few-shot examples used to compute the <span id="LST6.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">detection</span> scores of semantic regex feature descriptions. <span id="LST6.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;system&gt;&lt;/system&gt;</span>, <span id="LST6.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;user&gt;&lt;/user&gt;</span>, and <span id="LST6.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;assistant&gt;&lt;/assistant&gt;</span> delineate the message roles passed to the evaluation model. At prompt time, <span id="LST6.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{SEMANTIC_REGEX_DESCRIPTION}</span> is replaced with the semantic regex description in <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
