<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 9: </span>The evaluation model prompt used to compute the <span id="LST9.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">responsiveness</span> and <span id="LST9.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">purity</span> scores of natural language feature descriptions. <span id="LST9.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;system&gt;&lt;/system&gt;</span> delineates the message roles passed to the evaluation model.</figcaption>
</figure>
