<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 10: </span>The evaluation model prompt used to compute the <span id="LST10.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">responsiveness</span> and <span id="LST10.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">purity</span> scores of semantic regex feature descriptions. <span id="LST10.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;system&gt;&lt;/system&gt;</span> delineates the message roles passed to the evaluation model. At prompt time, <span id="LST10.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{SEMANTIC_REGEX_DESCRIPTION}</span> is replaced with the semantic regex description in <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
