<div id="lstnumberx642" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx642.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Output</span><span id="lstnumberx642.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">only</span><span id="lstnumberx642.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx642.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Python</span><span id="lstnumberx642.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">List</span><span id="lstnumberx642.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">object</span><span id="lstnumberx642.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">,</span><span id="lstnumberx642.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">without</span><span id="lstnumberx642.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">any</span><span id="lstnumberx642.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">additional</span><span id="lstnumberx642.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">comments</span><span id="lstnumberx642.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">,</span><span id="lstnumberx642.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">symbols</span><span id="lstnumberx642.24" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">,</span><span id="lstnumberx642.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">or</span><span id="lstnumberx642.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">extraneous</span><span id="lstnumberx642.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx642.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">content</span><span id="lstnumberx642.31" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx643" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx643.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;/</span><span id="lstnumberx643.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">system</span><span id="lstnumberx643.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&gt;</span>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 12: </span>The evaluation model prompt used to compute the <span id="LST12.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">clarity</span> scores of semantic regex feature descriptions. <span id="LST12.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;system&gt;&lt;/system&gt;</span> delineates the message roles passed to the evaluation model. At prompt time, <span id="LST12.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{SEMANTIC_REGEX_DESCRIPTION}</span> is replaced with the semantic regex description in <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Cost Analysis</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The cost to compute <span id="A4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">semantic-regex</span> feature descriptions is similar to the cost of prior methods.
If we were to compute feature descriptions for every feature in <span id="A4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">GPT-2-RES-25k</span>, we could compute semantic regexes for $65.27 using <span id="A4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gpt-4o-mini</span>.
This is on par with prior methods, where <span id="A4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">token-act-pair</span> would cost $67.67 and <span id="A4.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max-acts</span> would cost $54.01.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The description cost per feature is determined by the number of input tokens (system prompt and few-shot examples, <math id="A4.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{prompt}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{prompt}}</annotation></semantics></math>, the feature tokens, <math id="A4.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{feature}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>feature</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{feature}}</annotation></semantics></math>) and the generated output tokens (<math id="A4.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{out}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math>):</p>
<table id="A4.E1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Cost per Feature}\;=\;P_{\text{in}}(T_{\text{prompt}}\;+\;T_{\text{feature}})\;+\;P_{\text{out}}(T_{\text{out}})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cost per Feature</mtext><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><mo rspace="0.502em">+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>feature</mtext></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.502em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Cost per Feature}\;=\;P_{\text{in}}(T_{\text{prompt}}\;+\;T_{\text{feature}})\;+\;P_{\text{out}}(T_{\text{out}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(1)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A4.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{in}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{out}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math> are the API prices for input and output tokens.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We report the token counts and resulting costs for each feature description method in <a href="#A4.T4" title="Table A4 ‣ Appendix D Cost Analysis ‣ Semantic Regexes: Auto-Interpreting LLM Features with a Structured Language" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A4</span></a>.
The relative differences in the number of tokens are the result of <span id="A4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">token-act-pair</span> using more verbose example formatting than <span id="A4.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max-acts</span> and <span id="A4.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">semantic-regex</span>, <span id="A4.p3.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">semantic-regex</span> using fewer top activating examples <span id="A4.p3.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max-acts</span>, and <span id="A4.p3.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">semantic-regex</span> adding the additional semantic regex description to the input prompt.
At the time of writing, the OpenAI API costs<span id="footnote3" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">3</span>
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
          <a href="https://platform.openai.com/docs/pricing" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://platform.openai.com/docs/pricing</a></span></span></span> $0.15/$0.60 USD per million input/output tokens for <span id="A4.p3.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gpt-4o-mini</span>  and $2.50/$10.00 USD per million input/output tokens for <span id="A4.p3.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gpt-4o</span>.
These prices assume no input caching, which can vary due to resource availability, and thus are an upper bound on the total price.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table A4: </span>Cost analysis for feature description generation is based on the number of input tokens (system prompt, few-shot examples, and feature input) and generated output tokens.
We report the mean <math id="A4.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math> std number of tokens in the feature input and generated output over 130 features from <span id="A4.T4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gpt2-small</span>  (10 per layer). Tokenization is computed using OpenAI’s <span id="A4.T4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gpt-4o</span>  model family tokenizer.</figcaption>
<div id="A4.T4.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:397.5pt;height:47.8pt;vertical-align:-21.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-50.8pt,6.1pt) scale(0.796503156634666,0.796503156634666) ;">
<table id="A4.T4.6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A4.T4.6.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_td" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;"><span id="A4.T4.6.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">token-act-pair</span></td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;"><span id="A4.T4.6.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max-acts</span></td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;"><span id="A4.T4.6.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">semantic-regex</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T4.6.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;">Input Tokens: system and few-shot examples (<math id="A4.T4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{prompt}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>prompt</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{prompt}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;">919</td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;">483</td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;">993</td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T4.6.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;">Input Tokens: average per feature (<math id="A4.T4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{feature}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>feature</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{feature}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;"><math id="A4.T4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="457\pm 213" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>457</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>213</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">457\pm 213</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;"><math id="A4.T4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="524\pm 90" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>524</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">524\pm 90</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;"><math id="A4.T4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="237\pm 47" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>237</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>47</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">237\pm 47</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T4.6.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;">Output Tokens: average per generation (<math id="A4.T4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{out}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="A4.T4.6.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right" style="padding:1pt 6.5pt;"><math id="A4.T4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="9\pm\quad 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>±</mo></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9\pm\quad 3</annotation></semantics></math></td>
